{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">高盛：小米二季度手机毛利率超预期，汽车业务影响盈利</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">小米集团<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>财报最值得关注的判断，不是营收下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>这个表面数字，而是手机业务毛利率在出货量明显下降时反而升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.5%</span>，超出GS和一致预期。这份GS研报把手机毛利率视为本季最大正面亮点，同时指出汽车业务毛利率自<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2024年</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">四季度</span>以来首次跌破<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">20%</span>，成为盈利的主要影响因素。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>调整后净利润同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">43%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">62亿元</span>人民币，比GS预期高<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>，比一致预期低<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2%</span>。原因是公允价值收益和其他收入<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">高于预期</span>，抵消了运营费用上升带来的经营利润下滑。收入端基本符合预期，但结构上手机和汽车呈现完全相反的走势。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUfa8ZdElX9lYSywqvmIhyx1U60RJibRGib9vv82oaUKMfCbboSnNwPXTA1GpUEI5DIeiaOI8K68b4n5fbCOfkTmDNQgaHwPY4DDE/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 手机出货量降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26%</span>但毛利率升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.5%</span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看数字。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>手机出货量<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3120万</span>台，同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26%</span>，但平均售价从1074元升至1350元，涨幅<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26%</span>。量价对冲后，手机收入同比降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7%</span>，毛利率却达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.5%</span>，成为GS眼中本季最大的正面亮点。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">GS认为这体现了小米在元器件成本上升背景下，平衡出货量、售价和毛利率的执行力。研报将<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>手机毛利率预测从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.1%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.5%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9.3%</span>上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.9%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.9%</span>、9.5%，并预计毛利率可能在今年三季度触底。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 出货量降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26%</span>但毛利率反而<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>，说明小米主动调整了产品结构，把资源集中到高价位机型上。简单说，这是用规模换利润的选择，后续更值得观察的是这种取舍能否在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">四季度</span>新品密集发布后延续，而不是只看单季毛利率数字。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVFMqibyjkXshlexKrcsL1EIqDoXuJYBTjRlrfSLVEef4JAewWBK51ENhjrpIicG234zSr7QkvEWOxIUU84QejM1V16MNc47RCUc/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 汽车业务毛利率跌破<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">20%</span>，GS下调收入预测</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">汽车、AI及其他新业务收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">17%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">249亿元</span>，但比GS预期低<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>，比一致预期低<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8%</span>。原因是平均售价<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">低于预期</span>，叠加AI业务对毛利率的稀释，板块毛利率自<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2024年</span><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">四季度</span>以来首次降到20%以下。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">GS据此将<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>该板块收入预测下调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12%</span>，出货量预期调整为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">45万</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">74万</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">96万</span>辆，毛利率预测下调1.1至1.4个百分点至19.4%、20.0%、20.1%。研报对即将发布的SkyNomad车型的需求和盈利能力仍有信心，但短期财务影响已经反映在预测调整中。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把这件事拆开看，汽车业务的负beta效应正在显现。行业价格竞争加剧压低平均售价，小米作为新进入者难以独善其身。GS预计<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>汽车、AI等新业务<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">亏损</span>约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">80亿元</span>，手机业务<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">亏损</span>30至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">40亿元</span>，但集团整体调整后净利润仍预计为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">240亿元</span>，靠的是回报表现和其他收入支撑。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXdTiahA27f4CNXVxZAD75kFicQ8ymPsWiaDp22B8GmKadefBXX4AWe0HxRBgbGlDrjA2B91vcPK8mIXk8xJQlYxY9SHWyFFLjtek/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3. <span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">催化</span>剂密集，SkyNomad发布是首个观察点</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">研报指出，6月24日至7月29日期间小米报价上涨<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">39%</span>，跑赢恒生科技指数29个百分点，但此后回落<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">18%</span>，同期恒生科技指数仅跌<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3%</span>。GS认为新一轮<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">催化</span>剂窗口正在打开：9月初SkyNomad正式发布，10月初国庆假期结束前确认订单量；9月底小米18旗舰手机发布；IFA <span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>上米家品牌在欧洲规模化亮相；新一代Xring芯片和HyperOS系统发布；MiMo-V3模型及其他AI应用推出。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWp3dltKq3icduh5SibSRNyd0lR7BAD46JvgjYcmgSlFNlSTnJpibYs85XDfiapQlZybZydriciaafenslrQMKgLnzOj38zMjAsNgpibw/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 34-GS-Xiaomi Corp. -1810.HK- 2Q26 Review- Smartphone GPM Beats- EV Beta Weighs- New Catalyst Window Opens- 报告观点-260819</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
